            <p class="section-subtitle mt-3 mx-auto" data-anim data-delay="100" style="color: #555; max-width: 800px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                Exceptional artistry, intricate designs, and a touch of tradition – making your special moments unforgettable with the finest Mehandi!
            </p>
        </div>
        
